oint is, when you're trying to lie to shill, when you're trying to promote a course or promote some other option like a one-on-one that enriches you beyond belief and you stop providing value to your audience, and it all becomes about how you can line your pockets, I think at that point, you have to stop trusting people. So, that's all I have to say really about that. I know it's I know it probably sounds weird coming from me, but at the end of the day, I got in this to help people and uh that's what I'm going to continue doing. Um, like I keep saying, I hopefully am going to start increasing my upload schedule again. And look, we're just going to keep rolling with it, man. So, I believe in every single one of you guys. Hopefully, these music companies come back regardless of whether I like creators in this space or I like certain companies. I do want the best for all of you guys and we're all going to make it, bro. We just got to keep grinding. And uh yeah, I actually got another video coming out in the next couple days hopefully about like the volatility of shorts and showing some of my earnings and how unstable shorts revenue can be and what I'm doing to hedge against that. But with this news that dropped today, I feel like I need to at least make a video on YouTube about it. I talked a lot in my Discord about it, but I know a lot of people on YouTube aren't in the Discord, obviously. So, just something to note. Hopefully, these music companies come back. If not, rip, end of an era. And all I got to say, guys, is just take everybody's advice with a grain of salt. Mine included. You know, if I ever turn to somebody where I'm shilling stuff and I'm my my main purpose is to make money with something, then um I think I've lost the plot. And I would hopefully hopefully I'd have you guys come in and remind me of why I started this. Okay. So, I really want to help people with this channel. That's what I'm going to try to get back to doing. And uh yeah, let's just hope the best for all these music deal companies and hope we can all get our money and bag up.",
