eep grinding until I figure out a way around it. That's what you got to do. Look, especially if you have put tons of time into something like my channels. I've put countless hours. I put years into my channels, okay? Maybe some of you guys just want to give up. If that happens to me, I'm going to sit there say, \"All right, bet. Challenge accepted.\" 99% of the time, there is a way to adjust your strategy and get around any challenge that life throws at you. So, look, do I think we're all doomed? No. Some people who do mass- prodduced AI ranking, like any channel that does a bunch of stuff with templates, that might be more of an issue. You might have to add some commentary. You might have to add some criticism. But oftent times, a lot of these channels, to be honest with you guys, weren't even monetized in the first place with YouTube AdSense. But again, a lot of this is just speculation right now. I'm going off the same information that you guys are going off of. I'm just trying to use my brain to deduce what YouTube actually means. But so many people in my Discord and even in my comments when this news dropped, they're like over here dooming and panicking. Look, there's going to be hurdles in life. This is character development. Think about it like that if you have to. If you guys like my voice and want to use it in your videos, go check out the link in the description. It's my voice on 11 Labs. You can use it. If you guys want to get a YouTube shorts music deal, check out my latest video. It goes into detail about how I'm getting like 8 cent RPMs just for adding background music to one of my channels. And the link for that is in the description as well. I'm here for you guys. I want the community to all band together. We're all going to get through this. As long as you have the dedication and drive, this community is here for you. If you want to be part of the community, join the Discord. And I hope this video kind of alleviates some of you guys' concerns cuz a 