use uh Art of Work was the channel that at its peak was generating 40 million views per day. And uh back then, I was only posting uh twice. I have a graph here that shows uh first of all, 4 views. That's how much we generated on this channel. And at the beginning, we were posting one video a day uh pretty much until we got to the point where we were generating 150 million views a month. Then, we started posting twice a day and you can see how the channel exploded from there. Uh but it was still up and down. It was still pretty inconsistent. Uh and then, obviously, when the views uh dropped, we had the uh age restriction couple age restrictions in a row. We got the shadow banned for a second and then, obviously, the channel fell uh fell off a little bit and we started posting one a day again. So, the lesson here is that the moment your channel at its peak and is generating crazy amounts of views, you should be posting more because this just shows that there is a demand for this specific type of content on YouTube right now. All right. Finished shooting. Took a little bit longer than expected. Um But it turned out to be a freaking amazing video. So, excited for that. I don't know if the vlog is actually going to come out sooner or not. But anyways, check that out on the channel. A little bit tired by now, honestly. Because yeah, the first vlog been speaking the whole day. But I do have a bunch of calls lined up. So, the plan about what? 4:00 p.m. right now? Yeah, so the plan is uh we're going to wrap up the vlog. I'm going to take all of those calls and meetings that I have to do. And then it's going to be pretty much the end of the day. I do have a bunch of Discord messages as well to to reply to uh with clients. So, going to do that ASAP after we are done with this uh with this shooting. And after I'm back to the to the studio. But yeah, pretty excited how the vlog is going to turn turn out. Turned [ __ ] me. Yeah, you see I'm already losing the language. But uh exc